Hi Samantha and Lindsey,

I'd like to introduce you to Prof. Marcus Herrmann and Leo Dayal. They are =
building a CFD model of the CO2 capture from a mesh packet for the FLEX-DAC=
 project. They would like to get a pressure drop measurement through a mesh=
. It coudld be a packet or just a sheet of mesh. Please make sure to not th=
e pore size and percent open. This will likely require a different holder b=
ut could be just adhered across the face of the empty holder.

Eventually, we'll also want pressure drop measurements of the packets mount=
ed as they normally are, with flows parallel to the packet, but that will c=
ome later for the system design. If its easy to do with the other test then=
 by all means do them both.

Is this something you'd be able to do by Oct. 23?

I'm also attaching pressure drop data collected on Excellion sheets.

Justin

--_000_CH8PR06MB9997520A67D98DF043B193BF1E98922CH8PR06MB999752_
